 i5-2400 (quad-core) / AMD\u00ae FX-Series\u2122 FX-4300 (quad-core)"],["Memory","8 GB RAM"],["Graphics","NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GT 660 (2 GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 HD 7870 (2 GB)"],["Storage","10 GB available space"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"Survival horror gets a top-down treatment in Darkwood, set in a ruined, mysterious forest. By day you explore the changing landscape and scavenge for supplies; by night you retreat to a hideout, reinforce it and wait for dawn.\n\nYou travel between hideouts across several dense biomes, collecting resources, allies and information as you go. The locals offer dark quests and rewards, and the story shifts depending on the choices you make. It is a slow, tense single-player experience for horror fans who enjoy scarcity and uncertainty. Full controller support is included."}}